SM120/amd64 adaptation and experiment documentation:
Copyright 2026 Mark Yong

This repository records serving candidates for DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash at
TP3 (candidates/exl3/, candidates/uva/ and candidates/kraken-1017/).

The EXL3 candidate derives its build recipe (candidates/exl3/reproduce/
tempo-overlay/) from jakejharris/jspark3-deepseek (Tempo) at revision
bb386d39098e582fa1446cb96260cdef1df794f9. The Tempo NOTICE and
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md are preserved at this repository's root per
Apache-2.0 section 4(d). Overlay changes are limited to the amd64/SM120
port documented in candidates/exl3/README.md. The built container
image carries the components Tempo ships (vLLM Apache-2.0; MIT recipe and
plugin parts; NVIDIA vllm-openai base image), each under its own notice.

The official-checkpoint UVA candidate reproduces the recipe of peterkilfeather's
decoder-half UVA offload gist
(https://gist.github.com/peterkilfeather/7af387df07ff0df2327b8fd7f77596ed):
the overlay file candidates/uva/overlay/uva.py is his work (Apache-2.0,
pinned by sha256 in candidates/uva/NOTES.md), adapted from
local-inference-lab/vllm@66c29357; the compose file in candidates/uva/
compose/ is this repository's adaptation of his compose.yml (deltas
listed in its header). His measured Gen5 figures are cited with
provenance; this repository's own numbers come from the same-box run
recorded in candidates/uva/.

The Kraken 1017 candidate (candidates/kraken-1017/) runs BoxTops4Coochie's
recipe and image from
https://github.com/BoxTops4Coochie/RTX-PRO-6000-TP3-Inference-Recipes
(folder "DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash Kraken-tp3-20261019", commit
bcf72fe69b949dce447b2974e1315e1a757e73bf; image
azallaza/ds41-kraken-tp3:20261019.3). That repository carries no licence
file, so none of its files are copied here: candidates/kraken-1017/
links them by commit and lists this host's changes. The benchmark JSON
in candidates/kraken-1017/bench/ is output from his scripts and from
llm-inference-bench, measured on this repository's hardware. His
measured Gen5 figures are cited with provenance.
